# Vendored design reference — the HTML prototype + uncompiled source under
# design/handoff/ is reference material, NOT product code (the handoff README
# states tweaks-panel.jsx is "NOT part of the product"). We do not ship,
# import, or own it, so it must not gate CI. Our app code under src/ IS scanned.
design/handoff/

# E2E test drivers — these files orchestrate a real browser against the
# preview build (and, for the authed suite, the Firebase emulator). They
# legitimately need patterns semgrep's default ruleset flags as suspicious:
# http:// loopback URLs (emulator only speaks HTTP), localStorage.clear()
# (test isolation), indexedDB.deleteDatabase (test isolation), etc. These
# files NEVER ship to a browser — they only run inside Playwright's
# headless chromium during `npm run e2e*`. The app code they exercise
# (under src/) is still scanned.
e2e/

# --- Standard excludes ---
# A project .semgrepignore REPLACES semgrep's built-in defaults, so the usual
# noise/build dirs are re-listed here.
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
.git/
*.min.js
